  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 2026-11-06 - 10.0.0.6\n- Use single-detail validation exceptions for payment token failures.\n- Reference APF.Core.Clean.Common 10.0.0.12 for the nested error response envelope.\n## 2026-10-28 - 10.0.0.5\n\n- Added PiiEncryptionKey in SecuritySettings.\n\n## 2026-10-25 - 10.0.0.5-Beta-01\n- Fix single level error of validationException(message) so all 400 errors comes inside details\n- Reference APF.Core.Clean.Common 10.0.0.6-Beta-03 so validation failures use the same envelope.\n\n## 2026-10-08 - 10.0.0.4\n- Added UpdateAsync() in DynamoDbRepositoryBase\n\n## 2026-09-11 - 10.0.0.3\n\n- Aligned transaction FIFO routing with the legacy `EnableFifoTransaction` environment-variable behavior.\n- Registered SNS topic settings as part of the core AWS service registration.\n- Removed temporary SNS and SQS diagnostic logging.\n- Added structured diagnostics for transaction SNS FIFO routing and audit SQS publishing.\n\n\n\n## 2026-08-24 - 10.0.0.2\n- Dotnet 10 migration and updated github action.\n\n## 2026-08-14 - 10.0.0.1\n\n-  Published the Stable .net 10 compatible version\n\n##  2026-08-20 - 8.0.0.8\n\n- Registered the shared keyed cache service with its required structured logger.",
